<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>✅ 訂單送出成功 - 花禾子</title>
  <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { 
          font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif; 
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d4edda 0%, #c3e6cb 100%); 
          padding: 20px; 
          min-height: 100vh;
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: center;
          animation: fadeIn 0.5s ease-out;
      }
      @keyframes fadeIn {
          from { opacity: 0; }
          to { opacity: 1; }
      }
      .success-container {
          max-width: 600px;
          width: 100%;
          background: white;
          border-radius: 24px;
          box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(46, 125, 50, 0.2);
          overflow: hidden;
          animation: slideUp 0.6s ease-out;
      }
      @keyframes slideUp {
          from {
              opacity: 0;
              transform: translateY(30px);
          }
          to {
              opacity: 1;
              transform: translateY(0);
          }
      }
      .success-header {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745 0%, #20c997 100%);
          padding: 50px 30px;
          text-align: center;
          position: relative;
          overflow: hidden;
      }
      .success-header::before {
          content: '✓';
          position: absolute;
          font-size: 200px;
          color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
          top: -50px;
          right: -30px;
          font-weight: bold;
      }
      .success-icon {
          width: 100px;
          height: 100px;
          background: white;
          border-radius: 50%;
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          justify-content: center;
          margin: 0 auto 20px;
          box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
          animation: checkmark 0.8s ease-out;
          position: relative;
          z-index: 1;
      }
      @keyframes checkmark {
          0% {
              transform: scale(0) rotate(-45deg);
          }
          50% {
              transform: scale(1.2) rotate(10deg);
          }
          100% {
              transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg);
          }
      }
      .success-icon::after {
          content: '✓';
          font-size: 60px;
          color: #28a745;
          font-weight: bold;
      }
      .success-header h1 {
          color: white;
          font-size: 2.2em;
          margin-bottom: 10px;
          position: relative;
          z-index: 1;
      }
      .success-header p {
          color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
          font-size: 1.1em;
          position: relative;
          z-index: 1;
      }
      .success-body {
          padding: 40px 35px;
      }
      .order-summary {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff9f0 0%, #ffe8d0 100%);
          border: 3px solid #f4d9a6;
          border-radius: 16px;
          padding: 25px;
          margin-bottom: 30px;
          box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(244, 217, 166, 0.3);
      }
      .order-summary h2 {
          color: #8b7355;
          font-size: 1.3em;
          margin-bottom: 20px;
          text-align: center;
          border-bottom: 2px dashed #e8ddd0;
          padding-bottom: 12px;
      }
      .order-info {
          display: flex;
          justify-content: space-between;
          align-items: center;
          margin: 15px 0;
          padding: 12px 0;
          border-bottom: 1px solid #f4d9a6;
      }
      .order-info:last-child {
          border-bottom: none;
      }
      .order-info label {
          color: #6b5d4f;
          font-weight: 600;
          font-size: 1em;
      }
      .order-info span {
          color: #5d4e37;
          font-size: 1.1em;
          font-weight: bold;
      }
      .order-amount {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745 0%, #20c997 100%);
          color: white;
          padding: 20px;
          border-radius: 12px;
          text-align: center;
          margin: 25px 0;
          box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.3);
      }
      .order-amount label {
          display: block;
          font-size: 1em;
          margin-bottom: 8px;
          opacity: 0.95;
      }
      .order-amount .amount {
          font-size: 2.5em;
          font-weight: bold;
          letter-spacing: 2px;
      }
      .info-box {
          background: #f8f9fa;
          border-left: 5px solid #28a745;
          border-radius: 10px;
          padding: 20px;
          margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .info-box p {
          color: #5d4e37;
          line-height: 1.8;
          margin: 10px 0;
          font-size: 1em;
      }
      .info-box strong {
          color: #28a745;
      }
      .contact-box {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f4e8 0%, #d4edda 100%);
          border: 2px solid #a8d5a8;
          border-radius: 12px;
          padding: 25px;
          text-align: center;
          margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .contact-box h3 {
          color: #2e7d32;
          margin-bottom: 15px;
          font-size: 1.3em;
      }
      .contact-box p {
          color: #5d4e37;
          margin: 10px 0;
          font-size: 1.05em;
          font-weight: 500;
      }
      .contact-box .phone {
          font-size: 1.3em;
          color: #28a745;
          font-weight: bold;
          margin: 15px 0;
      }
      .bank-info {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd 0%, #ffe8a1 100%);
          border: 2px solid #ffc107;
          border-left: 5px solid #ff9800;
          border-radius: 12px;
          padding: 20px;
          margin: 25px 0;
      }
      .bank-info h3 {
          color: #ff9800;
          margin-bottom: 15px;
          font-size: 1.2em;
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 8px;
      }
      .bank-info p {
          color: #5d4e37;
          margin: 8px 0;
          font-size: 1em;
          padding-left: 10px;
      }
      .bank-info strong {
          color: #ff9800;
          min-width: 60px;
          display: inline-block;
      }
      .btn-container {
          display: flex;
          gap: 15px;
          margin-top: 30px;
      }
      .btn {
          flex: 1;
          padding: 16px;
          border: none;
          border-radius: 12px;
          font-size: 1.1em;
          font-weight: bold;
          cursor: pointer;
          transition: all 0.3s;
          text-decoration: none;
          display: inline-block;
          text-align: center;
      }
      .btn-primary {
          background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b7355 0%, #6b5d4f 100%);
          color: white;
          box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 115, 85, 0.3);
      }
      .btn-primary:hover {
          transform: translateY(-2px);
          box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(139, 115, 85, 0.4);
      }
      .btn-secondary {
          background: white;
          color: #8b7355;
          border: 2px solid #8b7355;
      }
      .btn-secondary:hover {
          background: #f5f0e8;
          transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      @media(max-width: 600px) {
          .success-header h1 { font-size: 1.8em; }
          .success-body { padding: 30px 25px; }
          .order-amount .amount { font-size: 2em; }
          .btn-container { flex-direction: column; }
      }
      .note-text {
          font-size: 0.9em;
          color: #6c757d;
          text-align: center;
          margin-top: 20px;
          font-style: italic;
      }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="success-container">
  <div class="success-header">
      <div class="success-icon"></div>
      <h1>訂單送出成功！</h1>
      <p>我們已收到您的訂單</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="success-body">
      <div class="order-summary">
          <h2>📋 訂單摘要</h2>
          <div class="order-info">
              <label>訂購人：</label>
              <span id="buyerName">-</span>
          </div>
          <div class="order-info">
              <label>取貨日期：</label>
              <span id="pickupDate">-</span>
          </div>
          <div class="order-info">
              <label>取貨時間：</label>
              <span id="pickupTime">-</span>
          </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="order-amount">
          <label>訂單金額</label>
          <div class="amount" id="orderAmount">$0</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="info-box">
          <p><strong>✓</strong> 您的訂單已成功送出</p>
          <p><strong>✓</strong> 我們已收到您的訂單，請盡快完成付款。</p>
          <p><strong>✓</strong> 完成付款後，請來電或私訊告知，謝謝！</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bank-info">
          <h3>🏦 銀行轉帳資訊</h3>
          <p><strong>銀行：</strong>台灣企銀</p>
          <p><strong>代碼：</strong>050</p>
          <p><strong>帳號：</strong>00712068817</p>
          <p><strong>戶名：</strong>繁花予槿商行郭書沅</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="contact-box">
          <h3>🌸 花禾子 Florescence</h3>
          <div class="phone">📞 0922-317-535 / 0984-259-170</div>
          <p>📍 台中市南屯區大墩十四街132號1樓</p>
          <p>📧 florescence.fs@gmail.com</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 0.95em; color: #6b5d4f;">⏰ 營業時間：12:00 - 24:00</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="btn-container">
          <a href="index.html" class="btn btn-primary">返回首頁</a>
          <a href="tel:0922317535" class="btn btn-secondary">📞 立即來電</a>
      </div>
      
      <p class="note-text">訂單編號將由店家確認後提供</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
// 從 sessionStorage 讀取訂單資料
window.onload = function() {
  const orderDataStr = sessionStorage.getItem('orderData');
  
  if (orderDataStr) {
      const orderData = JSON.parse(orderDataStr);
      
      document.getElementById('buyerName').textContent = orderData.buyerName || '-';
      document.getElementById('pickupDate').textContent = orderData.pickupDate || '-';
      document.getElementById('pickupTime').textContent = orderData.pickupTime || '-';
      document.getElementById('orderAmount').textContent = '$' + (orderData.amount || '0');
      
      // 清除 sessionStorage
      sessionStorage.removeItem('orderData');
  }
};
</script>

</body>
</html>
